meta {
  name: Member tags - List
  type: http
  seq: 206
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/member-tags
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The member tags of the community, by name (#1389, ADR 0060). Every member of the community. The owner, the admins and the moderators with the manage members right get every tag, with members_count; another member gets the tags with the visibility members, with members_count null. Each tag holds cuid, name, color (gray, red, orange, yellow, green, teal, blue or purple), visibility (members or managers), members_count and created_at. No pagination: a community has at most 100 tags. Token ability: member-tags:read.
}
